{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026YgosvQJPjX1793072237.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>全球大學校長及領袖高峰會一連兩日在灣仔會展舉行。</p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超、立法會主席李慧琼、中聯辦副主任孫尚武等，擔任揭幕禮主禮嘉賓。高峰會首日的教育論壇，以北都大學城與「政產學研投」為主題，而明天將舉行法律及青年人論壇。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.NORTH-1000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267jGsoeZUZQ1793072240.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><br/>會議為本港大專院校搭建交流平台，多名局長及本港大學校長出席外，亦有逾50間來自20多個國家的大學校長或管理層到場分享，包括美國哈佛大學和英國劍橋大學等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T04:22:04.460357+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T04:18:27.597604+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:18:27.597604+00:00","content_hash":"f57bce9f817939a534fc9fcf6f98cb55f3ac2d669ed70fd4b59d6806ac30a3b3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}